==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|SM Promo|Giratina|151}}, one of the {{TCG|SM Black Star Promos|Sun & Moon Black Star Promos}}.
*This card features {{p|Giratina}} in its {{form|Giratina|Altered Forme}}.
*'''Crisis Dive''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Ultra Prism|Giratina ♢|58}} from the {{TCG|Ultra Prism}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|X}}.

